WEBVTT

01:36.460 --> 01:41.150
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.550 --> 01:43.830
[Episode 2]

01:48.430 --> 01:49.280
Do you know

01:50.509 --> 01:54.120
who's behind the Gold and Silver Bank?

01:56.350 --> 01:56.880
Who is it?

01:57.560 --> 02:00.280
Fu Tianyi, the demon of the Power Gang.

02:02.400 --> 02:03.460
So what if it's him?

02:03.870 --> 02:06.400
Big Brother, you always say
we should uphold justice.

02:06.400 --> 02:08.000
You're the bravest of us all.

02:08.960 --> 02:10.030
Why do I feel like

02:10.750 --> 02:12.610
you're a different person today?

02:19.030 --> 02:20.490
It's actually because...

02:20.960 --> 02:21.800
Because...

02:22.190 --> 02:22.960
I got it!

02:25.240 --> 02:27.520
It's because the Power Gang
has never meddled in Jinzhong.

02:27.520 --> 02:28.680
Big Brother is worried

02:28.680 --> 02:30.140
that if we're discovered,

02:30.360 --> 02:31.079
they'll have

02:31.079 --> 02:33.360
a reason to attack
the martial world of Jinzhong, right?

02:33.360 --> 02:36.000
That's why
you want us to launch a sneak attack,

02:36.079 --> 02:36.750
right?

02:39.590 --> 02:41.030
I guess I'm a bit lucky.

02:42.800 --> 02:43.470
Yes.

02:44.560 --> 02:45.800
It seems Rou

02:46.960 --> 02:48.160
understands me best.

02:48.520 --> 02:49.960
That's exactly it.

02:52.079 --> 02:53.400
As expected of Big Brother.

02:53.400 --> 02:55.590
You think on such a grand scale.

02:56.560 --> 02:57.960
I agree.

02:58.400 --> 02:59.860
Big Brother, don't worry.

03:00.030 --> 03:01.120
Before we met you,

03:01.310 --> 03:02.400
we were just

03:02.400 --> 03:04.840
three young punks
who practiced martial arts all day.

03:04.840 --> 03:07.240
You guided us to start upholding justice.

03:07.870 --> 03:08.910
Whatever you want to do,

03:08.910 --> 03:10.030
just make the decision.

03:10.030 --> 03:11.360
We'll follow your lead.

03:12.000 --> 03:12.530
Alright.

03:13.960 --> 03:15.020
Then let's do this.

03:15.120 --> 03:15.720
Tomorrow,

03:17.150 --> 03:18.480
we'll set out for Zihui.

03:18.840 --> 03:19.280
Okay!

03:20.310 --> 03:20.840
Okay!

03:27.030 --> 03:29.079
Oh, no. I just remembered.

03:29.960 --> 03:31.220
In the original story,

03:31.710 --> 03:34.370
that was where Tang Rou
suffered a sneak attack.

03:43.150 --> 03:44.210
Oh right, Tang Rou.

03:44.520 --> 03:46.360
I don't think you should participate

03:46.360 --> 03:47.560
in this mission.

03:48.960 --> 03:49.630
Why?

03:51.120 --> 03:52.120
It's because...

03:53.120 --> 03:55.400
I met a fortune teller
a couple of days ago

03:55.750 --> 03:57.350
who did a divination for you.

03:57.590 --> 03:59.680
It showed that this trip
would bring more harm than good to you.

03:59.680 --> 04:00.810
It'll be dangerous.

04:05.910 --> 04:06.400
Hey.

04:07.190 --> 04:08.630
Why are you laughing?

04:08.710 --> 04:09.970
I'm telling the truth!

04:10.030 --> 04:11.630
-Big Brother.
-Big Brother.

04:12.750 --> 04:14.010
Are you being serious?

04:14.280 --> 04:15.010
Big Brother,

04:15.280 --> 04:17.750
when have our heroic deeds
ever been without danger

04:17.750 --> 04:20.120
Besides, even if I, Tang Rou, were afraid,

04:20.390 --> 04:23.270
the Rainstorm Pear Blossom Needles
at my waist certainly aren't.

04:23.270 --> 04:23.870
Hey guys,

04:23.870 --> 04:25.120
can't you be a little less reckless?

04:25.120 --> 04:26.650
I'm being serious with you!

04:27.600 --> 04:29.950
Big Brother, why are you being so fussy?

04:30.270 --> 04:33.330
Did that fortune teller
put a curse on you or something?

04:37.560 --> 04:39.920
Forget it.
Let's take it one step at a time.

04:40.830 --> 04:43.830
I should have read
the original story more carefully.

04:53.000 --> 04:56.490
[Zihui]

04:55.270 --> 04:55.750
Come on.

04:56.720 --> 04:57.450
Take it slow.

04:57.870 --> 04:58.310
Here.

04:58.560 --> 04:59.690
Careful. Thank you.

05:02.000 --> 05:03.160
Thank you. Take care, you two.

05:03.160 --> 05:04.760
-We're leaving.
-Take care.

05:04.920 --> 05:05.750
Don't worry, madam.

05:05.750 --> 05:06.600
-We'll be there soon.
-Alright.

05:06.600 --> 05:08.240
One basket of steamed buns
and four bowls of beef noodles.

05:08.240 --> 05:09.700
Certainly. Just a moment.

05:09.950 --> 05:11.240
Have a seat, Big Brother.

05:11.240 --> 05:11.600
This way.

05:11.600 --> 05:12.160
Big Brother.

05:12.160 --> 05:13.600
Here, have some tea first.

05:13.600 --> 05:16.750
Bravo!

05:16.950 --> 05:17.390
Here.

05:18.830 --> 05:20.800
These steamed buns look quite good.

05:20.800 --> 05:22.360
Bravo!

05:22.360 --> 05:23.120
Drink some water.

05:23.120 --> 05:24.830
-Move, move!
-!t's too hot today.

05:24.830 --> 05:25.920
What are you looking at?

05:25.920 --> 05:26.510
Move aside.

05:26.510 --> 05:27.070
Move!

05:28.510 --> 05:29.360
Move, move!

05:29.360 --> 05:30.290
Everyone, move!

05:30.310 --> 05:30.840
Hurry up.

05:32.270 --> 05:33.000
This... this...

05:33.000 --> 05:34.870
What's going on? What are you doing?

05:34.870 --> 05:35.430
Behave yourself.

05:35.430 --> 05:36.240
Let me go!

05:37.000 --> 05:38.530
-Move!
-What are you doing?

05:39.600 --> 05:40.430
Please spare me, sir!

05:40.430 --> 05:41.510
Please have mercy, sir!

05:41.510 --> 05:42.970
I'll give you one more day.

05:43.360 --> 05:44.240
Tomorrow at noon,

05:44.240 --> 05:46.390
if you don't deliver the money
to the Gold and Silver Bank,

05:46.390 --> 05:48.750
I'll burn this shabby boat of yours
to the ground.

05:48.750 --> 05:49.310
Stop!

05:55.240 --> 05:56.300
What are you doing?

05:56.630 --> 05:58.430
What's the matter? Want to be a hero?

05:58.430 --> 05:59.240
So what if I do?

05:59.370 --> 06:01.400
Sir, please don't fight!

06:01.430 --> 06:02.430
Please don't fight!

06:02.430 --> 06:03.270
If a fight breaks out here,

06:03.270 --> 06:04.750
my business will be ruined.

06:04.750 --> 06:05.600
That's right.

06:05.950 --> 06:07.550
Did you hear that, young man?

06:07.720 --> 06:09.270
They're going to save them?

06:09.430 --> 06:10.000
One day.

06:10.110 --> 06:11.600
-Yes, yes, yes, sir.
-Just one day.

06:11.600 --> 06:12.130
Let's go.

06:13.190 --> 06:13.720
Let's go.

06:15.310 --> 06:17.000
Are you two alright, gentlemen?

06:17.000 --> 06:19.000
-Thank you, sirs.
-Thank you, sirs.

06:19.630 --> 06:21.720
Tang Rou, why don't you go ask

06:21.920 --> 06:25.180
and see what's going on
with that boat captains over there?

06:30.310 --> 06:31.720
Captain, what's wrong?

06:32.110 --> 06:34.680
Don't mention it.
We scraped together all our savings

06:34.680 --> 06:36.360
and finally managed to buy a boat

06:36.360 --> 06:37.560
just to make a living.

06:37.680 --> 06:38.340
In the past,

06:38.680 --> 06:41.950
we used to pay tribute
to Zhu the Great King of the waterway.

06:42.190 --> 06:44.430
Now, we're using
the river's branch routes,

06:44.430 --> 06:47.750
and we're being extorted
by the Gold and Silver Bank.

06:48.720 --> 06:50.430
The war has just eased for a few years.

06:50.430 --> 06:51.890
How can we make any profit?

06:51.950 --> 06:54.510
We can't keep this business going
like this.

06:55.000 --> 06:56.400
The Gold and Silver Bank?

06:57.000 --> 06:58.120
Them again?

06:58.360 --> 07:00.430
Why is this Gold and Silver Bank
so tyrannical?

07:00.430 --> 07:01.690
No one in the Wubei area

07:01.830 --> 07:03.800
dares to offend the Gold and Silver Bank.

07:03.800 --> 07:05.390
They can make life

07:05.390 --> 07:06.480
more miserable than death.

07:06.480 --> 07:07.480
Indeed.

07:08.680 --> 07:09.430
Here it is.

07:09.950 --> 07:12.280
The NPCs are here
to push the plot forward.

07:12.480 --> 07:13.510
Let's not talk about it anymore.

07:13.510 --> 07:14.680
Let's go, let's go.

07:15.240 --> 07:15.770
Let's go.

07:20.920 --> 07:23.360
Big Brother, it seems your lead
was right.

07:24.120 --> 07:25.160
They're such bullies.

07:25.160 --> 07:28.420
Big Brother, we must pay a visit
to the Gold and Silver Bank.

07:28.430 --> 07:28.800
Yes.

07:32.270 --> 07:33.830
Is there such a rush?

07:34.159 --> 07:35.490
We need to plan this out.

07:35.830 --> 07:37.750
Besides, the noodles
haven't even been served yet.

07:37.750 --> 07:38.680
Come on, sit down and eat.

07:38.680 --> 07:39.920
What's there to plan? Let's go, let's go!

07:39.920 --> 07:40.630
-What plan?
-It's too late.

07:40.630 --> 07:41.390
Let's go, Big Brother.

07:41.390 --> 07:41.950
Let's go.

07:42.310 --> 07:43.360
But I'm hungry.

07:43.360 --> 07:43.950
Let's go.

07:43.950 --> 07:44.630
Your sword!

07:44.630 --> 07:45.800
Big Brother, this way please.

07:45.800 --> 07:46.190
Sir,

07:46.190 --> 07:47.600
-your beef noodles...
-No need anymore!

07:47.600 --> 07:48.530
What's going on?

07:52.010 --> 07:55.940
[Gold and Silver Bank]

07:58.510 --> 07:59.440
It's right here.

08:05.870 --> 08:06.360
Come on.

08:06.600 --> 08:08.630
Brothers, come on, take these.

08:08.950 --> 08:10.010
Once we're inside,

08:10.240 --> 08:12.430
remember, don't reveal your identities
no matter what.

08:12.430 --> 08:13.690
Put these on properly.

08:14.600 --> 08:17.240
Big Brother, we're here to uphold justice.

08:17.480 --> 08:18.160
No need.

08:18.560 --> 08:19.600
That's right, let's go.

08:19.600 --> 08:22.310
You won't wear them for night operations?
Put them on!

08:22.310 --> 08:22.830
Take it.

08:25.870 --> 08:26.430
Um,

08:27.270 --> 08:29.470
those buns aren't sitting well with me.

08:29.870 --> 08:31.560
I need to use the toilet.

08:32.270 --> 08:34.070
You all need to be extra careful.

08:35.510 --> 08:36.570
Don't go, don't go.

08:37.200 --> 08:39.730
You're pulling this trick again,
aren't you?

08:39.840 --> 08:41.080
I know what you're doing.

08:41.080 --> 08:42.390
You're doing the same thing as last time,

08:42.390 --> 08:43.150
trying to send us away

08:43.150 --> 08:45.360
so you can face
the strong enemy alone, right?

08:45.360 --> 08:46.960
Big Brother, let me tell you,

08:47.080 --> 08:48.870
it's absolutely not happening this time.

08:48.870 --> 08:49.670
That's right.

08:49.960 --> 08:51.560
I'm not joking with you guys.

08:52.030 --> 08:53.430
Anyway, I'm telling you,

08:53.630 --> 08:55.290
it's very dangerous in there.

08:55.720 --> 08:57.360
You must be extremely careful.

08:57.360 --> 08:58.240
Do you understand?

08:58.240 --> 09:00.040
Please, please be very careful.

09:01.550 --> 09:04.080
There's nothing we can do about him.
Let's go.

09:05.440 --> 09:06.510
What do you mean?

09:06.630 --> 09:07.440
I'm talking to you guys.

09:07.440 --> 09:08.570
Where are you going?

09:09.550 --> 09:11.350
Isn't the entrance right there?

09:11.960 --> 09:13.960
Big Brother, make way.

09:15.630 --> 09:16.840
W-What are you doing?

09:17.790 --> 09:18.480
Move aside.

09:19.720 --> 09:20.780
What are you doing?

09:32.080 --> 09:32.940
Oh my goodness!

09:40.120 --> 09:41.250
They really can fly.

09:44.550 --> 09:45.600
How about

09:46.000 --> 09:46.910
I give it a try?

09:51.750 --> 09:53.080
No way,

09:53.240 --> 09:55.500
I don't have any lightness skills at all.

09:57.240 --> 09:59.440
This is today's rent from Hehan Street.

10:00.870 --> 10:04.150
This is the tribute from the 18 shops
at the street corner today.

10:04.150 --> 10:05.150
Good, good, good.

10:05.270 --> 10:07.510
That woman from the gold shop
said business was bad.

10:07.510 --> 10:09.440
She was crying and refusing to pay.

10:09.720 --> 10:10.910
I dragged her back here.

10:10.910 --> 10:11.550
Boss,

10:11.840 --> 10:13.120
what do you want to do with her?

10:13.120 --> 10:14.320
Blind her

10:14.630 --> 10:15.910
and throw her in the marketplace

10:15.910 --> 10:17.640
to set an example for everyone.

10:30.840 --> 10:31.630
Who dares

10:31.790 --> 10:34.250
to cause trouble
at the Gold and Silver Bank?

10:34.960 --> 10:37.220
Do you know who the owner
of this place is?

10:37.550 --> 10:40.880
Isn't it Fu Tianyi, the Iron-Fisted Demon
of the Power Gang?

10:41.440 --> 10:42.600
Since you know,

10:42.750 --> 10:44.030
why are you still here?

10:50.080 --> 10:51.610
Not only are we not leaving,

10:52.270 --> 10:53.530
but we're also going to

10:53.600 --> 10:54.200
eliminate

10:54.600 --> 10:55.270
you

10:55.480 --> 10:55.940
trouble

10:56.120 --> 10:56.630
makers.

10:59.550 --> 11:00.960
That's quite a bold statement.

11:00.960 --> 11:02.000
Chop them into pieces

11:02.000 --> 11:04.530
and throw them into the river
to feed the fish!

11:28.960 --> 11:30.360
Are we really doing this?

11:43.320 --> 11:46.030
Zuoqiu's silk-binding
grappling technique is impressive.

11:46.030 --> 11:47.160
Clean and powerful.

11:48.000 --> 11:49.200
As fellow swordsmen,

11:49.320 --> 11:52.630
Yuhan's Hailin Sword Sect's technique
is known for its intricacy.

11:52.630 --> 11:55.030
His lethality is not to be underestimated.

11:56.840 --> 11:57.770
Flying daggers.

11:58.200 --> 12:00.480
The Tang Sect's hidden weapons
are indeed formidable.

12:00.480 --> 12:02.670
No wonder the Tang Sect
has stood strong for a century.

12:02.670 --> 12:05.440
My underlings are quite impressive.

12:15.120 --> 12:17.840
Blood... It really is blood.

12:39.420 --> 12:40.060
Where is Fu Tianyi?

12:40.060 --> 12:40.930
I don't know.

13:04.870 --> 13:06.870
Escaping is the best strategy of all.

13:06.870 --> 13:08.600
Staying alive is the priority.

13:12.840 --> 13:14.030
Be careful.

13:14.440 --> 13:14.970
Alright.

13:20.790 --> 13:21.270
Hey.

13:23.910 --> 13:24.670
Captain,

13:24.910 --> 13:26.170
where are you heading?

13:26.360 --> 13:27.550
Sir, you are...

13:29.790 --> 13:31.080
Don't you remember?

13:32.110 --> 13:34.790
Yesterday at the dock,
when you were being bullied,

13:34.790 --> 13:37.080
my brothers and I came to your rescue.

13:37.390 --> 13:38.750
-Oh, it's you, young hero.
-Yes, yes.

13:38.750 --> 13:39.870
It's the young hero.

13:39.870 --> 13:41.470
Young hero, you may not know,

13:41.600 --> 13:43.440
but we've gathered some silver

13:43.630 --> 13:46.240
and are about to deliver it
to the Gold and Silver Bank.

13:46.240 --> 13:48.750
Yes, we hope they'll show mercy

13:48.750 --> 13:49.720
and forgive us.

13:49.720 --> 13:50.520
That's right.

13:52.240 --> 13:53.840
You don't need to go anymore.

13:53.960 --> 13:56.390
Someone has already
eliminated the threat for you.

13:56.390 --> 13:57.440
How is that possible?

13:57.440 --> 13:59.910
That's the Power Gang's
Gold and Silver Bank!

13:59.910 --> 14:00.870
Indeed.

14:05.870 --> 14:06.630
Don't worry.

14:07.630 --> 14:10.670
No one will bully you anymore.

14:11.750 --> 14:12.390
Ah...

14:13.240 --> 14:15.150
-Thank you, young hero.
-Thank you, young hero.

14:15.150 --> 14:15.910
Hurry and go.

14:15.910 --> 14:16.630
Lad.

14:19.720 --> 14:22.910
You hired people to wipe out
the Gold and Silver Bank?

14:23.390 --> 14:24.320
Well done!

14:24.790 --> 14:26.750
That Gold and Silver Bank
was utterly heartless,

14:26.750 --> 14:28.440
committing numerous crimes.
It should've been destroyed long ago.

14:28.440 --> 14:29.240
Stop talking!

14:48.430 --> 14:49.090
Young hero!

14:53.360 --> 14:54.360
You talk too much.

14:55.390 --> 14:57.190
A man fishing in the wind and rain

14:57.200 --> 14:59.360
on the huge rock at the riverside dock...

14:59.360 --> 15:01.120
He's the Iron-Fisted Demon, Fu Tianyi?

15:00.380 --> 15:02.340
[Iron-Fisted Demon of the Power Gang]
[Fu Tianyi]

15:02.960 --> 15:04.560
I've already run so far away.

15:04.960 --> 15:06.490
How can I still run into him?

15:07.870 --> 15:09.910
This plot twist feels too forced.

15:12.320 --> 15:13.050
You go first.

15:13.120 --> 15:14.120
Okay, okay, okay.

15:22.240 --> 15:22.900
Don't move.

15:23.840 --> 15:25.170
Kneel down, kneel down.

15:26.510 --> 15:27.510
Behave yourself.

15:27.790 --> 15:28.510
Kneel!

15:31.990 --> 15:33.510
[Northern Wasteland Seal]

15:32.390 --> 15:33.390
I never expected

15:33.960 --> 15:37.360
the Gold and Silver Bank would
conspire with Northern Wastelanders.

15:37.360 --> 15:39.000
But these people are too tight-lipped.

15:39.000 --> 15:40.910
We can't get them to reveal
the mastermind's whereabouts.

15:40.910 --> 15:42.170
We've fought all night

15:42.440 --> 15:45.670
but still can't find
the Iron-Fisted Demon's whereabouts.

15:45.670 --> 15:48.000
These three young heroes
are incredibly skilled.

15:48.000 --> 15:48.840
Did you see?

15:49.080 --> 15:51.740
They destroyed
the entire Gold and Silver Bank.

15:56.790 --> 15:57.390
Tang Rou.

15:58.390 --> 16:01.270
There's something I must tell you.

16:02.270 --> 16:03.150
What is it?

16:04.600 --> 16:05.530
Be careful of...

16:09.270 --> 16:10.070
What's wrong?

16:13.800 --> 16:14.600
It's nothing.

16:15.550 --> 16:16.410
Remember this.

16:16.870 --> 16:19.530
You must be wary
of someone holding an umbrella.

16:20.150 --> 16:21.810
Someone holding an umbrella.

16:22.010 --> 16:24.740
Come on, you're really
being superstitious now.

16:25.080 --> 16:25.600
Well...

16:27.200 --> 16:28.120
Besides,

16:28.510 --> 16:30.970
it doesn't even look like
it's going to rain.

16:31.510 --> 16:32.360
Can you be more serious?

16:32.360 --> 16:33.690
I'm not joking with you.

16:33.870 --> 16:35.440
Remember what I said. The key point is,

16:35.440 --> 16:36.750
be careful of someone holding an umbrella.

16:36.750 --> 16:37.810
Do you understand?

16:38.510 --> 16:39.970
Everyone has an umbrella.

16:40.550 --> 16:42.210
Who am I supposed to be wary of?

16:42.670 --> 16:43.270
Exactly.

16:43.270 --> 16:44.840
These villains deserve to be
dealt with properly.

16:44.840 --> 16:46.500
The rain stopped so suddenly.

16:46.630 --> 16:47.440
The rain has stopped.

16:47.440 --> 16:50.700
The rain has stopped.
Who would still be using an umbrella?

16:51.440 --> 16:52.030
Make way!

16:52.030 --> 16:53.230
Heaven is on our side.

16:54.030 --> 16:55.480
The constables are here!
The constables are here!

16:55.480 --> 16:56.670
They should all be arrested.

16:56.670 --> 16:57.240
Take them all away.

16:57.240 --> 16:57.840
These are the villains.

16:57.840 --> 16:59.270
Yes, arrest them all.

17:01.320 --> 17:02.270
Arrest these beasts!

17:02.270 --> 17:02.630
Don't move!

17:02.630 --> 17:03.430
That's right.

17:05.160 --> 17:06.220
Who are you people?

17:06.589 --> 17:08.030
We're here to rid the people of harm.

17:08.030 --> 17:10.720
You government-paid officials
finally show up now.

17:10.720 --> 17:12.920
May I ask the names
of you righteous heroes?

17:12.920 --> 17:13.680
We are...

17:15.270 --> 17:16.589
There's no need to know our names.

17:16.589 --> 17:18.480
Those scoundrels
are locked up in the back.

17:18.480 --> 17:20.010
You can just take them away.

17:21.550 --> 17:23.720
The Gold and Silver Bank has been
exploiting the people for a long time.

17:23.720 --> 17:25.240
As a mere constable,

17:25.550 --> 17:28.410
I've never dared to take action.
I'm truly ashamed.

17:29.030 --> 17:29.880
But I'm afraid

17:30.240 --> 17:32.310
you've only caught some small fry.

17:32.640 --> 17:34.100
The real boss, however...

17:34.400 --> 17:36.400
Do you know where their real boss is?

17:38.890 --> 17:41.160
You need to understand.
If you don't tell us now,

17:41.160 --> 17:42.160
you'll be the ones

17:42.240 --> 17:43.700
in trouble after we leave.

17:49.600 --> 17:51.510
Alright, I'll take you there.

18:07.830 --> 18:08.690
Oh my goodness!

18:47.310 --> 18:48.840
Isn't that our Big Brother?

18:50.960 --> 18:52.960
-Big Brother!
-So Big Brother found Fu Tianyi already.

18:52.960 --> 18:54.020
What did I tell you?

18:54.160 --> 18:55.620
He ran off on his own again.

18:56.270 --> 18:58.920
Don't come over! It's dangerous!

18:59.200 --> 19:00.660
Big Brother, don't worry!

19:00.960 --> 19:02.240
We won't interfere.

19:02.350 --> 19:05.210
We'll leave
the toughest Iron-Fisted Demon to you.

19:05.310 --> 19:07.350
Big Brother, you've got this!

19:07.550 --> 19:08.270
Beat him up!

19:08.270 --> 19:09.030
Come on, Big Brother!

19:09.030 --> 19:10.200
You pig-headed fools!

19:10.200 --> 19:11.880
What kind of encouragement is this?

19:11.880 --> 19:13.080
Come on, Big Brother!

19:21.480 --> 19:23.280
-Come on!
-Come on, Big Brother!

19:45.750 --> 19:49.280
Huanhua Sword Technique, Second Form:
Soaring to the Heavens!

19:54.920 --> 19:57.180
Third Form: Plucking Petals and Leaves!

20:00.110 --> 20:01.960
Fourth Form: Starry Sky!

20:07.270 --> 20:08.070
Big Brother! Big Brother!

20:08.070 --> 20:09.030
Are you hurt? Are you okay?

20:09.030 --> 20:09.960
Are you alright?

20:11.240 --> 20:11.960
I'm fine.

20:19.920 --> 20:21.310
So my subconscious mind

20:22.510 --> 20:25.640
remembers the martial arts
this body practiced before.

20:26.480 --> 20:28.000
Huanhua Sword Technique.

20:28.750 --> 20:31.350
Since when did Xiao Xilou's people

20:31.750 --> 20:34.000
dare to oppose the Power Gang?

20:38.160 --> 20:41.200
I heard you killed my men.

20:41.880 --> 20:43.830
Then stay and fill the vacancies.

20:44.160 --> 20:45.480
Work for me.

20:46.640 --> 20:48.170
You won't refuse, will you?

20:49.590 --> 20:50.590
What do you think?

20:50.750 --> 20:52.270
Of course we're not willing.

20:52.270 --> 20:54.130
You think you can order us around?

20:57.200 --> 21:00.070
How could you all be a match for me?

21:02.110 --> 21:04.240
One-on-one, of course we're not.

21:06.000 --> 21:08.960
But four against one is a different story.

21:10.960 --> 21:13.590
You think you have four people?

21:15.400 --> 21:18.000
It's not a guess. It's a fact.

21:20.270 --> 21:23.920
What if I make you lose one person?

21:24.960 --> 21:26.160
One less... Tang Rou!

21:31.000 --> 21:32.270
It's you!

21:36.600 --> 21:37.530
Are you alright?

21:39.160 --> 21:39.960
Tang Rou.

21:41.680 --> 21:42.940
Good thing I have this.

21:43.240 --> 21:44.960
Here, take this.

21:46.110 --> 21:47.170
For self-defense.

21:51.790 --> 21:52.480
Underwear?

21:54.550 --> 21:55.830
This isn't my size.

21:56.680 --> 21:57.680
Tie it around you.

22:03.310 --> 22:05.640
No one can ambush
a member of the Tang Sect.

22:06.030 --> 22:07.920
Remember that.

22:08.510 --> 22:11.640
Not one of us four will be missing.

22:13.790 --> 22:15.310
Then you four...

22:16.270 --> 22:17.830
can prepare to die!

23:02.210 --> 23:03.810
-Big Brother!
-Big Brother!

23:09.550 --> 23:10.160
Charge!

23:10.160 --> 23:10.960
Kill!

23:38.970 --> 23:40.170
Is everyone alright?

23:42.070 --> 23:42.790
We're fine.

23:43.160 --> 23:45.720
The Iron-Fisted Demon
lives up to his name.

23:50.880 --> 23:52.810
He's truly impervious to weapons.

23:54.110 --> 23:56.480
Fu Tianyi's hands are impenetrable.

23:59.070 --> 24:00.000
Tang Rou, Yuhan,

24:00.030 --> 24:01.030
restrain his arms!

24:01.030 --> 24:02.760
Zuoqiu, attack his lower body!

24:02.960 --> 24:03.400
Go!

25:10.880 --> 25:12.740
This move, the Flower Rain Sword,

25:13.750 --> 25:15.550
uses the blade as a hidden weapon,

25:15.550 --> 25:17.400
and the scabbard as the killing blow.

25:17.400 --> 25:18.530
It's truly amazing.

25:23.480 --> 25:24.350
He's dead.

25:24.880 --> 25:26.550
Big Brother, he's dead!

25:29.160 --> 25:29.890
Big Brother!

25:29.960 --> 25:31.310
We... We won!

25:32.200 --> 25:33.000
We won!

25:41.310 --> 25:41.920
Tang Rou,

25:43.920 --> 25:45.850
thank goodness you're still here.

25:46.270 --> 25:47.330
Of course I'm here.

25:52.400 --> 25:55.680
I... I actually used
the Xiao family's martial arts

25:56.680 --> 25:58.110
to kill Fu Tianyi?

25:59.160 --> 26:00.790
Of course you used martial arts.

26:00.790 --> 26:02.450
What else could you have used?

26:04.030 --> 26:04.720
It seems

26:04.920 --> 26:06.980
this Power Gang isn't all that great.

26:07.070 --> 26:09.200
Today, we killed the Iron-Fisted Demon.

26:09.200 --> 26:11.140
Tomorrow, we can kill
the Eight Heavenly Kings

26:11.140 --> 26:12.620
and the Nineteen Demons.

26:12.790 --> 26:15.160
That's right, let's kill them all!

26:16.000 --> 26:18.160
Eight Heavenly Kings, Nineteen Demons...

26:18.160 --> 26:20.240
Oh right, in the original story,
the Power Gang

26:20.240 --> 26:22.300
discovered that we killed Fu Tianyi,

26:22.310 --> 26:24.000
so they besieged the Xiao family.

26:24.000 --> 26:24.660
This is bad.

26:27.030 --> 26:27.960
Yuhan, Chaoran,

26:28.400 --> 26:29.480
go get some money

26:30.030 --> 26:31.430
to silence that boatman.

26:32.720 --> 26:34.390
Tang Rou, go buy a small boat

26:34.790 --> 26:35.990
and get some lamp oil.

26:36.160 --> 26:36.790
Why?

26:37.000 --> 26:38.400
What do you mean "why?" Just go quickly!

26:38.400 --> 26:40.030
Don't ask so many useless questions!

26:40.030 --> 26:40.830
Go!

26:41.000 --> 26:41.590
Let's go.

26:47.610 --> 26:48.810
Someone really died.

26:51.070 --> 26:51.680
I...

26:52.790 --> 26:55.200
What... What have I done?

27:56.350 --> 27:59.720
Are we destroying evidence?

28:05.720 --> 28:06.440
Brothers,

28:08.000 --> 28:09.400
don't think too much now.

28:10.240 --> 28:12.270
It's perfect timing to leave Zihui

28:12.510 --> 28:13.640
before it gets dark.

28:14.000 --> 28:15.030
Let's go, let's go.

28:15.030 --> 28:15.560
Let's go.

28:23.160 --> 28:24.890
Sirs, your dishes are all here.

28:25.110 --> 28:25.880
Alright.

28:27.720 --> 28:28.000
Waiter.

28:28.000 --> 28:28.830
Sir, please enjoy your meal.

28:28.830 --> 28:29.480
Thank you for your hard work.

28:29.030 --> 28:32.480
[Everlasting Prosperity]

28:31.350 --> 28:31.830
Come on.

28:32.590 --> 28:34.270
We should have run far enough by now.

28:34.270 --> 28:35.870
Finally, we can eat in peace.

28:35.920 --> 28:36.440
Chopsticks.

28:36.440 --> 28:37.400
Let's eat.

28:37.750 --> 28:38.210
Come on.

28:40.480 --> 28:41.200
By the way,

28:41.790 --> 28:44.750
we clearly did the martial world a favor
by eliminating evil.

28:44.750 --> 28:46.400
Why are we acting like criminals?

28:46.400 --> 28:47.930
That's right, Big Brother.

28:51.110 --> 28:52.310
Come here, come here.

28:53.830 --> 28:55.030
Why else could it be?

28:55.160 --> 28:56.290
I'm afraid of dying.

28:56.750 --> 28:57.680
Afraid of dying?

28:57.960 --> 29:00.030
W-When have we ever been afraid of death?

29:00.030 --> 29:00.550
Yeah.

29:03.270 --> 29:05.030
I've known you for so many years.

29:05.030 --> 29:08.430
It's the first time I've heard you say
you're afraid of dying.

29:11.440 --> 29:12.900
Are you sick or something?

29:22.790 --> 29:23.850
Come on, everyone.

29:29.030 --> 29:29.830
Let me ask you,

29:30.550 --> 29:34.400
Is it more worthwhile
to kill one or 10 villains?

29:34.590 --> 29:35.830
Killing 10, of course.

29:35.830 --> 29:36.630
That's right.

29:39.200 --> 29:40.750
As the saying goes,

29:41.270 --> 29:44.000
"Keep a low profile, be humble,
don't get cocky."

29:45.240 --> 29:46.160
That's true.

29:47.110 --> 29:47.880
Look,

29:48.590 --> 29:50.070
the four of us

29:50.160 --> 29:53.070
barely managed
to defeat one villain today.

29:53.440 --> 29:56.300
What if the remaining evil members
of the Power Gang

29:56.590 --> 29:58.070
came after us together?

30:01.070 --> 30:03.440
We'd be finished for sure.

30:04.790 --> 30:05.590
So...

30:07.510 --> 30:09.000
We must prepare secretly,

30:09.720 --> 30:12.680
quietly build up our strength,

30:13.550 --> 30:16.950
and then gradually eliminate evil
and protect the innocent.

30:17.590 --> 30:19.250
When we have enough strength,

30:19.750 --> 30:21.550
we can challenge the Power Gang.

30:22.000 --> 30:23.830
Then we'll kill them all.

30:24.350 --> 30:25.480
Come on,

30:26.110 --> 30:27.620
eat up. It's on me today!

30:28.640 --> 30:29.640
That makes sense.

30:30.680 --> 30:31.680
I'm starving.

30:34.510 --> 30:35.510
I understand now.

30:35.790 --> 30:37.960
Big Brother is thinking about
building up our strength

30:37.960 --> 30:40.420
to face the Power Gang head-on
in the future.

30:43.480 --> 30:46.510
Truly a role model for our generation.
I'm impressed.

30:53.030 --> 30:55.290
Well... That's not exactly what I meant.

30:58.000 --> 30:58.790
I got it!

31:00.400 --> 31:02.830
Big Brother, remember that thing
we talked about before?

31:02.830 --> 31:04.290
Today is the perfect time.

31:06.310 --> 31:07.310
Yes, Big Brother,

31:07.790 --> 31:08.830
now is the right time.

31:08.830 --> 31:09.400
Right.

31:23.160 --> 31:25.200
Let's forget about this cliché plot.

31:25.200 --> 31:27.240
How can we forget about it, Big Brother?

31:27.240 --> 31:29.440
Three months ago, you said it yourself.

31:29.880 --> 31:32.510
After we've done a truly righteous deed,

31:32.830 --> 31:36.290
we'll officially establish
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood.

31:40.160 --> 31:40.750
Tang Rou.

31:46.270 --> 31:47.930
Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood?

31:50.030 --> 31:51.880
Wasn't it the Four Brothers of Jinjiang?

31:51.880 --> 31:54.340
Big Brother, what's wrong
with your memory?

31:54.400 --> 31:55.530
You said it yourself

31:56.000 --> 31:58.070
that we shouldn't limit it
to just Jinzhong.

31:58.070 --> 32:00.070
We should gather righteous men
from all over the world.

32:00.070 --> 32:02.590
That's why we formed
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood.

32:02.590 --> 32:05.590
Today is the birth
of the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood.

32:08.720 --> 32:11.270
The original Xiao Qiushui
was quite rebellious, huh?

32:11.270 --> 32:12.830
Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood?

32:12.830 --> 32:14.000
This name

32:14.000 --> 32:15.130
is quite ambitious.

32:16.160 --> 32:16.550
Big Brother.

32:16.550 --> 32:17.510
This knife...

32:17.720 --> 32:20.450
-Has this knife been disinfected?
-Big Brother?

32:32.510 --> 32:33.640
Do you have a needle?

32:34.920 --> 32:35.450
A needle?

32:43.070 --> 32:45.200
This... This knife isn't rusty, is it?

32:45.750 --> 32:47.510
W-Why is everyone so intense?

32:53.310 --> 32:56.000
Heaven above, with the moon as witness,

32:56.200 --> 32:59.530
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood
will live and die together.

33:02.310 --> 33:03.310
Are they for real?

33:10.310 --> 33:11.840
What's wrong, Big Brother?

33:11.880 --> 33:12.410
Drink up!

33:14.440 --> 33:15.000
Yes!

33:20.440 --> 33:21.070
Cheers!

33:21.880 --> 33:22.240
Cheers!

33:22.240 --> 33:23.070
From today on,

33:23.270 --> 33:26.600
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood
will live and die together.

33:26.680 --> 33:27.640
Live and die together.

33:27.640 --> 33:28.640
Yes, Big Brother!

33:33.310 --> 33:34.710
Living together is fine,

33:34.880 --> 33:38.140
but dying together...
that might not be necessary, right?

33:39.640 --> 33:40.440
That's true.

33:41.070 --> 33:43.270
If we ever face a life-or-death crisis,

33:43.480 --> 33:46.030
I'm willing to give my chance of survival
to Big Brother.

33:46.030 --> 33:46.680
Me too.

33:46.750 --> 33:47.400
Agreed.

33:52.510 --> 33:56.160
Why are you all
talking such nonsense so seriously?

33:56.350 --> 33:57.880
Come on, stand up and talk.

33:58.480 --> 34:00.280
Stand up to talk. Stop kneeling.

34:01.110 --> 34:02.030
We are serious.

34:06.140 --> 34:07.200
Is Xiao Qiushui...

34:09.280 --> 34:11.110
really worth all this loyalty?

34:11.710 --> 34:15.320
That year when I first left Tang Sect
and fell into a villain's trap,

34:15.320 --> 34:17.760
it was you who risked your life
to lure away the villains,

34:17.760 --> 34:19.190
allowing me to escape.

34:19.800 --> 34:20.730
And at that time,

34:21.760 --> 34:24.020
we were just strangers who met by chance.

34:24.070 --> 34:27.400
Big Brother, when Chaoran and I
went out to gain experience,

34:27.510 --> 34:29.400
we recklessly fought
and injured our internal energy.

34:29.400 --> 34:31.460
You were just passing by at that time,

34:31.800 --> 34:34.070
but you stayed with us in that temple
for three days and nights.

34:34.070 --> 34:35.030
From that moment on,

34:35.030 --> 34:35.840
I knew

34:36.150 --> 34:38.840
you were the big brother
I'd follow through life and death.

34:38.840 --> 34:42.110
The Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood
was born out of chivalry.

34:42.550 --> 34:43.780
As long as you're here,

34:43.780 --> 34:44.780
chivalry exists.

34:44.880 --> 34:45.360
Yes.

34:45.510 --> 34:46.070
Yes!

34:56.550 --> 34:58.670
This talk is getting
more and more inauspicious.

34:58.670 --> 35:00.930
What nonsense are you all talking about?

35:01.870 --> 35:04.720
Since you all call me Big Brother,

35:06.280 --> 35:07.480
it means you trust me.

35:08.420 --> 35:09.750
Then as the Big Brother,

35:11.500 --> 35:14.500
I have the responsibility
to take good care of you all.

35:15.790 --> 35:18.400
So, we all need to live well.

35:18.590 --> 35:20.630
That's right, live well.

35:21.480 --> 35:22.110
Live well.

35:22.760 --> 35:23.590
Live well.

35:23.960 --> 35:25.150
Let me pour you some wine.

35:25.150 --> 35:28.010
-Let me pour Big Brother a drink.
-Fill it up for him.

35:30.110 --> 35:33.710
Xiao Qiushui was such a noble
and righteous young man.

35:34.480 --> 35:35.810
I'm using his identity,

35:36.230 --> 35:37.630
so I can't let them down.

35:39.030 --> 35:42.760
Okay, as long as I can
complete the mission, I can go back.

35:44.440 --> 35:46.880
Before that, I'll protect them well.

35:56.960 --> 35:59.160
You spoiled key plot points to Tang Rou,

35:59.320 --> 36:01.190
affecting the direction of the story.

36:01.190 --> 36:03.400
The Boiling Blood Cocoon
warning punishment begins.

36:03.400 --> 36:04.150
Countdown.

36:04.480 --> 36:06.760
Three, two, one.

36:46.400 --> 36:49.000
The Boiling Blood Cocoon
warning punishment ends.

36:49.000 --> 36:50.360
The next activation

36:50.360 --> 36:53.030
will officially deplete
the user's health points.

36:53.030 --> 36:56.810
And from now on,
the plot difficulty increases.

37:01.230 --> 37:02.560
Difficulty increased?

37:04.110 --> 37:06.310
How much more do you want to increase it?

37:07.190 --> 37:08.590
You might as well kill me.

38:04.590 --> 38:06.960
I spoiled the plot to Tang Rou
and saved him,

38:06.960 --> 38:09.230
which activated the Boiling Blood Cocoon.

38:09.230 --> 38:11.710
If it happens again, I'll really be dead.

38:13.110 --> 38:14.190
But strangely,

38:15.400 --> 38:17.460
the Power Gang used Fu Tianyi's death

38:17.630 --> 38:19.830
to besiege the Xiao family for revenge.

38:20.110 --> 38:22.240
But I've already disposed of the body.

38:22.630 --> 38:25.880
Why am I still dreaming about
the Xiao family being massacred?

38:25.880 --> 38:27.680
Could it be that this isn't over?

38:27.920 --> 38:30.480
Regardless, I need to be fully prepared.

38:31.280 --> 38:34.220
I can't let the original story's tragedy
happen again.

38:34.220 --> 38:36.540
If you can become the leader
of Huanhua Sect,

38:36.540 --> 38:38.830
you can enter your own outline mode.

38:39.070 --> 38:41.400
The Magic Codex will no longer interfere.

38:42.000 --> 38:44.200
So if I become
the leader of Huanhua Sect

38:44.510 --> 38:46.770
and eliminate the Boiling Blood Cocoon,

38:46.840 --> 38:48.900
I can lead the direction of the story?

38:49.630 --> 38:51.480
That would be perfect.

39:00.030 --> 39:02.160
How exactly do I become the sect leader

39:03.070 --> 39:05.000
and change the story's direction?

39:14.030 --> 39:15.920
Xueyu being an adopted daughter

39:15.920 --> 39:17.180
was content I created.

39:17.760 --> 39:21.020
It means the Magic Codex
kept some of my characterization.

39:23.190 --> 39:26.150
What about the cheat mode I set up before?

39:31.360 --> 39:33.030
If I remember correctly,

39:34.440 --> 39:35.900
at the bottom of this river

39:36.230 --> 39:38.120
is an invincible treasure sword.

39:39.760 --> 39:40.890
And in the cave here,

39:41.440 --> 39:43.970
there's a white wolf
skilled in martial arts.

39:44.760 --> 39:47.880
In these ruins, there's a Gatling gun.

39:50.280 --> 39:51.540
And most importantly,

39:52.070 --> 39:54.330
I created a lucky bag NPC named Feng Lang.

39:55.360 --> 39:57.070
He's highly skilled in martial arts

39:57.070 --> 39:58.800
and completely obedient to me.

40:00.000 --> 40:02.400
As long as
one of these cheats is still here,

40:04.000 --> 40:05.800
changing the story's direction

40:07.710 --> 40:08.840
will be much easier.

40:10.940 --> 40:11.500
Tang Rou!

40:12.840 --> 40:13.440
Yuhan!

40:14.190 --> 40:14.800
Zuoqiu!

40:15.320 --> 40:16.280
Wake up, wake up!

40:17.590 --> 40:20.390
Big Brother, aren't you
getting up a bit too early?

40:21.510 --> 40:22.320
I'm so sleepy.

40:22.320 --> 40:25.190
What do you mean early?
The sun's already shining on your butts.

40:25.190 --> 40:26.250
Still sleeping in?

40:27.920 --> 40:31.320
Big Brother, it's raining.
Do we still have to go out?

40:32.910 --> 40:34.760
Let me tell you,
this is called a sun shower.

40:34.760 --> 40:36.160
It'll stop raining soon.

40:39.670 --> 40:40.670
Come on, let's go.

40:40.830 --> 40:44.190
♪ Ha ♪

40:44.210 --> 40:48.330
♪ Why don't we just
live freely in the world? ♪

40:48.640 --> 40:52.460
♪ We meet again
after crossing mountains and seas ♪

40:50.960 --> 40:52.800
Big Brother, take a look at this.

40:53.000 --> 40:57.050
♪ Heaven and earth between us,
yet never truly apart ♪

40:54.440 --> 40:54.920
Catch!

41:02.440 --> 41:04.040
The invincible magic sword?

41:05.760 --> 41:07.590
Isn't this just a foot filer?

41:10.150 --> 41:11.750
And that Gatling-something

41:12.230 --> 41:14.030
is obviously just a chamber pot.

41:14.510 --> 41:16.000
And the most ridiculous thing?

41:16.000 --> 41:19.000
It's this big gray wolf
that's supposed to teach martial arts.

41:19.000 --> 41:20.110
Go away!

41:22.000 --> 41:24.150
Why is this white wolf yellow?

41:27.070 --> 41:30.230
The system said last night
it would increase the difficulty.

41:30.230 --> 41:31.150
Does that mean

41:31.400 --> 41:33.930
it's going to take away
all the cheats I wrote?

41:34.110 --> 41:35.110
Then Feng Lang, the powerful

41:35.110 --> 41:36.110
lucky bag NPC,

41:36.630 --> 41:38.430
definitely won't be here for me.

41:39.360 --> 41:40.090
Big Brother,

41:40.320 --> 41:42.380
you woke us up so early in the morning,

41:42.630 --> 41:45.360
but you haven't told us
what we're supposed to do.

41:55.150 --> 41:56.920
Actually, I did all this because

41:56.920 --> 41:59.580
I just want to be the sect leader
of Huanhua Sect.

42:01.070 --> 42:01.800
Sect leader?

42:03.320 --> 42:05.710
Big Brother, you're not
joking with us, are you?
